    "reviews": "\u201cThis is the game I have been waiting for!!!   To me there is something much more scary about climbing a man-made concrete structure than a 'natural' scenic cliff or mountain. And this 'Tree Of Life' skyscraper scared me almost to death. I would happily have paid 20-30 pounds JUST FOR THIS ONE BUILDING.\u201d<br>5 \u2013 cassey_neil<br><br>\u201cThe immersion is quite good. When it comes to the later levels, it feels very high and scary when climbing \ufeff\u201d<br>5 \u2013 hd19830511<br><br>\u201cThere is a mysterious magic of this game.\u201d<br>5 \u2013 SKeLeton<br>",
